                                                "sense_id": "8dfa18ef-7462-3c71-abb7-ca25ab64e988",
                                                "text": "I apologize for giving you another name a moment ago, that was a brain freeze on my part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "807c5d7e-def4-40a1-a1ed-60e3ca4254e4",
                                                "sense_id": "8dfa18ef-7462-3c71-abb7-ca25ab64e988",
                                                "text": "I call it a brain freeze at this age, but whenever you have some kind of a problem remembering something, you think, oh, you know, you automatically think about Alzheimer’s."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37142b60-df41-4b64-af2a-44539465d32b",
                                                "sense_id": "8dfa18ef-7462-3c71-abb7-ca25ab64e988",
                                                "text": "Call it a brain freeze, another 'Aleppo moment,' or a mere campaign stumble, but Gary Johnson has stumbled again in his quixotic presidential campaign."
                                            }
